<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM, Sun, Digital started by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM, Sun, Digital started by DLJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said on Tuesday it started coverage of International Business Machines Corp and Sun Microsystems Inc with buy ratings and Digital Equipment Corp with a market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- IBM rose 5/8 to 104-5/8, Sun Microsystems gained 1-13/16 to 49-9/16 and Digital rose 1/2 to 46-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
